Podman Desktop is a graphical application for working with containers and
Kubernetes. It lets you manage containers, images, pods and volumes, inspect
logs and open a terminal into running containers, build images, and work with
Kubernetes contexts and YAML, using the native FreeBSD podman (jails through
ocijail) as the container engine.

This port is based on a snapshot of the Podman Desktop sources with FreeBSD
support and runs on the Electron framework provided by the ports collection.
